    "date": "2022-04-17",
    "term": "でも",
    "kana": "でも",
    "meaning": "but, however",
    "level": "N5",
    "pos": ["conjunction", "particle"],
    "stratum": "wago",
    "processes": [],
    "headline": "でも is で, the て-form of the copula だ/です, plus も (“even; too”).",
    "morphemes": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "quote": "で (de, conjunctive (\"て-form\") of copula だ/です) + も (mo, “even; too”)."
      },
      {
        "quote": "When でも follows a noun, で is the conjunctive or \"て-form\" of the copula だ/です. で can also appear in the conjunctive form of certain classes of verbs; in that case, でも can be analyzed as the conjunctive form of the verb + the inclusive particle も, and means \"even if\"; compare with the allomorph ても used for different classes of verbs."
      }
    ],
    "wiktionaryDump": "2026-09-02"
  },
